### [GET] Top rated movies — returns up to 10 results from TMDB
GET http://localhost:8081/movies/top-rated

### Expected response shape:
### {
###   "results": [
###     {
###       "imdbId": "tt...",
###       "title": "...",
###       "year": "...",
###       "poster": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/...",
###       "rating": "9.3"
###     },
###     ...
###   ]
### }

### Verify:
### - results array has 10 items
### - every item has a non-null imdbId (tt format)
### - every poster URL starts with https://image.tmdb.org
### - rating is a string formatted to 1 decimal place